      "statement": "hybridQuery is the end-to-end search pipeline: it runs a BM25 probe that can skip LLM query expansion on a strong signal (disabled when intent is given), fuses ranked lists with reciprocal rank fusion, selects the best chunk per candidate, reranks chunks rather than full bodies, blends rank with reranker score, and dedups by file before applying the limit.",
