    {
      "id": "claim_ff4f1ed061654e61b19943e6fbf5be91",
      "statement": "qmd embed takes an exclusive process-level lock in .qmd-embed.lock beside the index database. When the lock file already exists, tryAcquireEmbedLock reads the recorded PID and treats the lock as held only if isLiveEmbedLockHolder accepts it, which delegates to isQmdMcpPid (the PID is alive and its command line looks like qmd). Otherwise the lock is stale: the file is removed and the create is retried once; if a live holder still owns it, the function returns null so the second embed is skipped.",
